@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] soundbank-native-publication
The owned soundbank import MUST validate all source bindings, complete slot maps and
actual PCM before mutating /Game/AudioBanks. Original cue packages MUST remain untouched.
Saved waves MUST use the declared mono 48 kHz PCM/ForceInline/loop policy. A separate
cold editor MUST verify the exact package and hard-reference closure before publishing
the staged registry. Candidate receipts MUST NOT be accepted as runtime registries.
The normal build and cook MUST include every consumed package and runtime registry.
